LIST OF Arduino Pins Used

GND     (GLOBAL GROUND)
+5V     (HX711)

PIN 2,3   (Solenoid Relay OUT/IN)
PIN 6,7   (HX711)
PIN 8-11  (STEPPER + MOTORSHIELD)


//SOLENOID powered via POWER RELAY

PIN2 --- VCC -->             |-------------| NO ---> (NOTHING)
Arduino GND --- GND -->      | POWER RELAY |COM  --- POWER SOURCE (~13V)
Arduino GND --- IN -->       |-------------| NC  --- PIN 3

LOGIC:

if(V_CC == HIGH) 
  OUT = IN
if (V_CC == LOW)
  OUT = 0V


//MOTOR SHIELD (via Stepper.h):
IN1 --> PIN8
IN2 --> PIN9
IN3 --> PIN10
IN4 --> PIN11
 
VCC <--- POWER SUPPLY (~17V , 0.7A)
GND <--- Arduino GND
+5V (from Arduino)

M1: One Side of Stepper

M2: Other Side of Stepper

//HX711:

ARDUINO GND ---> GND
HX711_dout ---> PIN 6
HX711_sck --> PIN 7
V_CC ---> ARDUINO +5V
